        <briefdescription>
<para>Given a memory access, invalidate anything this walker knows about that access. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This API is used by walkers that store information to perform basic cache invalidation. This will be called by <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_s_s_a" kindref="compound">MemorySSA</ref> at appropriate times for the walker it uses or returns. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
