    <briefdescription>
<para>A <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_s_s_a_walker" kindref="compound">MemorySSAWalker</ref> that does <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_a_a" kindref="compound">AA</ref> walks to disambiguate accesses. </para>
